      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-02-17T17:37:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I do prefer the podcast version rather than the raw video because I listed to the audio at 1.25-1.5 speed. Granted, that makes Adam sound even MORE hyper at times, but it doesn't feel like a slog.</p>\n<p>The Nemesis discussion makes me think: have folks done house rules that have alternate Nemesis effects? Like Adam said, it's just an icon, and the rules aren't on the cards themselves, so it's easy to use or ignore, but that also means it would be easy enough to modify.</p>\n<p> </p>",
      "post_number": 4,
