      "created_at": "2021-02-17T21:52:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've grabbed tokens from my old Tactics set, sometimes, to represent different effects. For example, an \"Aim\" token for Chrono-Ranger: the Best of Times' base power.</p>\n<p>What is this about Ambuscade not being French? Ridiculous! How will Ambuscade and Stuntman's puns work, what happened to the Isle of Doctor Moreau reference, and what excuse will I have to insist that any Stuntman player speak in an over the top French accent?!</p>",
