      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I've grabbed tokens from my old Tactics set, sometimes, to represent different effects. For example, an \"Aim\" token for Chrono-Ranger: the Best of Times' base power.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is this about Ambuscade not being French? Ridiculous! How will Ambuscade and Stuntman's puns work, what happened to the Isle of Doctor Moreau reference, and what excuse will I have to insist that any Stuntman player speak in an over the top French accent?!</p>",
