    {
      "id": 235148,
      "name": "dpt",
      "username": "dpt",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-02-17T22:40:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Powerhound2000&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Powerhound2000\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Feels like adding tokens to recall the nemesis symbol being there kind of defeats the purpose of having the nemesis symbol on the card.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The point is to put something that isn’t usually there. If you always put it on the card, yes, it’s pointless, but introducing an element that is only sometimes there will make your mind notice it.</p>",
